                                            "radiotelephony clear-code word for the letter R."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Roger",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4190978-aead-372b-a70a-55e5a45cb7cf",
                                        "entry_id": "f2cdd540-1375-3392-8054-efb584996fee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A male given name from the Germanic languages."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7874d7f-116e-4494-ab50-289d9b199dea",
                                                "sense_id": "b4190978-aead-372b-a70a-55e5a45cb7cf",
                                                "text": "By her I claim the kingdom: she was heir / To Roger, Earl of March, who was the son / Of Edmund Mortimer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04dc9110-323e-4592-bc44-6b32df800e30",
                                                "sense_id": "b4190978-aead-372b-a70a-55e5a45cb7cf",
                                                "text": "Pringle didn't say anything about Roger always being called Hodge. He sensed that Mr. Liddon wouldn't call him Hodge any more than he would call him Pringle. He was right. \"Parents well, are they, Peregrine?\" - - -\nHodge capered about, his thumbs in his ears and his hand flapping. \"Tweet, tweet, mad bird. His master chains him up like a dog. Tweet, tweet, birdie!\" \"I'd rather be a hunting falcon than Roger the lodger the sod,\" said Pringle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d304fc1-7f87-486f-a859-499afc8747d1",
                                                "sense_id": "b4190978-aead-372b-a70a-55e5a45cb7cf",
                                                "text": "Details of Thunberg’s charge came as Just Stop Oil said its cofounders, Indigo Rumbelow and Roger Hallam, were arrested on Wednesday morning following dawn raids at their homes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91c0d59e-e2fb-32d1-b999-e98cfb8eccae",
                                        "entry_id": "f2cdd540-1375-3392-8054-efb584996fee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A surname originating as a patronymic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "67df34f9-3783-3d0b-a311-c8d5e9c08c5a",
                                        "entry_id": "f2cdd540-1375-3392-8054-efb584996fee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The Devil; Satan."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dialectal",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa8064a2-787a-3c63-b3f0-09ae680c75bb",
                                        "entry_id": "f2cdd540-1375-3392-8054-efb584996fee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Jolly Roger (pirate flag)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e3208f2-3bf6-4721-b9ce-9e03d5f74722",
                                                "sense_id": "aa8064a2-787a-3c63-b3f0-09ae680c75bb",
                                                "text": "The escaped convicts who had captured the Arrow even ran up the “Roger,” the black flag with the white skull […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4a9f916f-df0b-4e60-9016-f0b5a57a507f",
                        "source_entry_id": "ce0289fa-b300-319d-9e10-e916951ede06",
                        "source_sense_id": "b3a97d71-2956-3266-b458-52e7c1fe8e8e",
                        "source_sense_description": "männlicher Vorname",
                        "target_lang_word": "Roger",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Roger",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c267dcf2-4e71-3c87-922d-15e7cefa982d",
                                        "entry_id": "e619e700-f6fa-3b33-8459-1ea55658d0d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nom de famille."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f07857fd-e680-4ec8-9fa2-04a2cc902037",
                                                "sense_id": "c267dcf2-4e71-3c87-922d-15e7cefa982d",
                                                "text": "L’organisation est colossale, et, pourtant, le plus gros enjeu reste « de rassembler les Français », atteste Vincent Roger, auteur de Paris 2024, un défi français (L’Archipel), et ancien délégué spécial pour les JO de la région Île-de-France."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d41a1af8-b33e-3fbf-afcc-f59b27d03083",
                                        "entry_id": "e619e700-f6fa-3b33-8459-1ea55658d0d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personnage du Roland furieux de L'Arioste, retenu prisonnier par la magicienne Alcine sur son île."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "622e2902-dc64-49ba-a274-8ea02e4ab31f",
                                                "sense_id": "d41a1af8-b33e-3fbf-afcc-f59b27d03083",
                                                "text": "Donc mon cœur était plein de chimérique attente, comme le bon Roger qui bée après Alcine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Roger",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3fe70b44-8929-312f-bc6b-180b3a0f7578",
                                        "entry_id": "3da6cf62-1291-3d12-a155-182a2a046251",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prénom masculin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
